#: feedreading_blogroll.php:121 feedreading_blogroll.php:1210
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:2481 feedreading_blogroll.php:2513
msgid "This widget adds the WP Social Blogroll to your sidebar."
msgstr "Aquest giny afegeix el WP Social Blogroll a la barra lateral"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:121 feedreading_blogroll.php:1210
msgid ""
"It can display multiple link categories. Only a single instance of this "
"widget can be added to your sidebars."
msgstr ""
"Pot mostrar més d'una categoria d'enllaç. Només es pot emprar un giny "
"d'aquest tipus a la vegada."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:161
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Opcions"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:543
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Opcions desades."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:579 feedreading_blogroll.php:2554
msgid ""
"You are currently using WordPress version %s. Please be informed, that "
"future versions of the WP Social Blogroll plugin will no longer support this "
"version of WordPress. I recommend to upgrade your WordPress-installation to "
"<a href=\"http://wordpress.org\">the latest version</a>."
msgstr ""
"Estàs fent servir la versió %s de WordPress. T'informo que futures versions "
"del WP Social Blogroll no funcionaran en aquesta versió. Et recomano "
"actualitzar WordPress a <a href=\"http://wordpress.org\">l'última versió</a>."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:589 feedreading_blogroll.php:2547
msgid ""
"If you have just upgraded to WordPress 2.8, you will have to add the Widget "
"of the WP Social Blogroll plugin to your sidebar again. <a href=\"%s"
"\">Please go to the Widget-Settings-Page</a> to add the widget to your "
"sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Si tot just has actualitzat a la versió 2.8 de WordPress, hauràs de tornar a "
"afegir el giny de WP Social Blogroll a la barra lateral. <a href=\"%s\">Ves "
"a la pàgina de configuració de ginys</a> per tornar-lo a afegir."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:601
msgid ""
"JavaScript-file <strong>and</strong> content-directory are writable. This is "
"no longer necessary. You should make the content-directory read-only (chmod "
"755) now for security-reasons.</p><p>This plugin requires <strong>only</"
"strong> JavaScript-file itself to be writable."
msgstr ""
"L'arxiu JavaScript <strong>i</strong> el directori de contingut tenen permís "
"d'escriptura. Això ja no cal. Hauries de fer que el directori de contingut "
"fos de només lectura (chmod 755) per raons de seguretat.</p><p>Aquest giny "
"<strong>només</strong> necessita que l'arxiu JavaScript es pugui escriure."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:608
msgid "Content directory and/or JavaScript-file not writable!"
msgstr "El directori de contingut i/o l'arxiu JavaScrip no es poden escriure!"

